  "description": "Fuaran.Core.OpStream — append-only hash-chained op stream + deterministic replay + JSONL persistence, generic over an (apply, encode, decode) witness. The highest-genericity core layer; the linear spine the branching-DAG generalisation builds on. Over the Fuaran.Core.Text kernel (hash, escape, string and number grammar); FSharp.Core only; Fable-clean on encode and decode alike - the JSONL line reader (Jsonl) runs under both pipelines.",
